  "description": "An EF Core extension library for high-performance bulk data synchronization using SQL MERGE, supporting both IEnumerable<T> and IAsyncEnumerable<T> data sources.\n\t\t  The library is optimized for working with DevExpress XAF system fields (GCRecord, OptimisticLockField), as well as custom versioning and change-tracking fields (RowState, RowStamp). It supports state-aware record processing, including handling of deleted objects, and provides utilities for temporarily disabling foreign key constraint checks during synchronization operations.",
